OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners fear loss of 'public'
OL,4,Aplaying fields
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners say a school's playing
OL,7,Ffield has been lost as a public space
OL,8,Fafter a new booking system introduced
OL,9,Fby its owners.
OL,11,FLower Field, also known as Elmhirst
OL,12,FField, near King Edward VI Community
OL,13,FCollege in Totnes, Devon, is owned by
OL,14,Fthe schools' trust Education South
OL,15,FWest, which has earmarked it for sale.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
