OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners fear loss of 'public'
OL,4,Aplaying fields
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners said the field was widely
OL,7,Fused for everything, from casual
OL,8,Ffootball matches and picnics to
OL,9,Forganised sports and community events
OL,10,Fand they said the booking system was "a
OL,11,Fmodern enclosure of public space and
OL,12,Fleisure time".
OL,14,FThe trust said it was "important that
OL,15,Fwe know who is using the site and when,
OL,16,Fboth so that we can manage access
OL,17,Feffectively and keep the site safe and
OL,18,Fsecure".
